  <BTG_Settings_Default>(預設)</BTG_Settings_Default>
  <!-- 商人公會 is Odyssey zh-Hant TradersGuild.label; 軌道商人 is from its description. -->
  <!-- EN: How often orbital traders rotate at Traders Guild settlements. -->
  <BTG_Settings_TraderRotationDesc1>商人公會據點的軌道商人多久輪替一次。</BTG_Settings_TraderRotationDesc1>
  <!-- EN: Lower values will give more variety, but less time to reach distant settlements. -->
  <BTG_Settings_TraderRotationDesc2>數值越低，商人種類會越多樣，但前往遠方據點的時間也會越少。</BTG_Settings_TraderRotationDesc2>

  <!-- ========== MOD SETTINGS: CUSTOM LAYOUTS ========== -->
  <!-- EN: Use custom settlement map generator -->
  <BTG_Settings_UseCustomLayouts>使用自訂據點地圖生成器</BTG_Settings_UseCustomLayouts>
  <!-- EN: When enabled, Traders Guild settlements will generate with furnished, lived-in interiors. When disabled, they will use the vanilla layouts, or allow other mods' map generation to run.\nThe smuggler's den always uses its own map generator. -->
  <BTG_Settings_UseCustomLayoutsDesc>啟用時，商人公會據點生成時會有家具齊全、有人居住感的內部。停用時，將使用原版佈局，或讓其他模組的地圖生成運作。\n走私巢穴一律使用它自己的地圖生成器。</BTG_Settings_UseCustomLayoutsDesc>
  <!-- EN: Vanilla Gravship Expanded - Chapter 2 is active: its Traders Guild station is generated instead, with some of this mod's additions layered on top. -->
  <BTG_Settings_UseCustomLayoutsVGE2Note>Vanilla Gravship Expanded - Chapter 2 已啟用：改為生成其商人公會據點，並在其上疊加本模組的部分附加內容。</BTG_Settings_UseCustomLayoutsVGE2Note>
  <!-- EN: Vanilla Gravship Expanded - Chapter 2 is active: the settings below currently only affect the smuggler's den. Its Traders Guild stations keep vanilla garrisons and defeat rules for now. -->
  <BTG_Settings_DefendersVGE2Note>Vanilla Gravship Expanded - Chapter 2 已啟用：以下設定目前只影響走私巢穴。其商人公會據點暫時仍維持原版駐軍與戰敗規則。</BTG_Settings_DefendersVGE2Note>

